    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/c6a371e9f5277e24c2a8401d6fd8a4c5.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/c6a371e9f5277e24c2a8401d6fd8a4c5.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instant Sports Action!</h2><br>Sports Sports is an action-packed, competitive sports game.<br>Master 30+ varied sports events with retro arcade gameplay inspired by classic Track &amp; Field games and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/e46c10ec3150a0ca44af3458e7441996.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/e46c10ec3150a0ca44af3458e7441996.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run, Jump, Throw, Swim, Fight and more!</h2><br>Compete in: Sprint, Hurdles, Long Jump, Boxing, Relay, Long Distance, Swimming, Archery, Javelin, Shot Put, Weightlifting, Cycling, Triple Jump, BMX Race, Hammer, Shooting, Rowing, High Jump, High Diving, Pole Vault, Kayaking, Discus, Arm Wrestling, Rock Paper Scissors and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/8c40c322222557e76bbc056482c12800.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/8c40c322222557e76bbc056482c12800.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/b0995806adaa69b63f21b1a3a5340de3.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/b0995806adaa69b63f21b1a3a5340de3.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards &amp; Multiplayer!</h2><br>Play against friends via local multiplayer or play ranked matches to rise to the top of the global leaderboards.<br>Sports Sports is easy to play, and quick to have you screaming for a re-match!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your perfect Athlete!</h2><br>Customise your athlete and grow your cabinet of Trophies and Medals. Battle to be the best!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/adac5811b183824bef0889f1bee90c91.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/adac5811b183824bef0889f1bee90c91.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/4b3d2bc0ee421da3a2001ec1ac328dcc.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/4b3d2bc0ee421da3a2001ec1ac328dcc.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help decide which Sports we add next!</h2><br>We plan to make Sports Sports the largest sports game ever. Help decide which sports we add in next! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/1e62209853b5dc20ac5e92463de3f94d.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/1e62209853b5dc20ac5e92463de3f94d.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/1e62209853b5dc20ac5e92463de3f94d.mp4?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/60fbb8845338e6aba0a4aa3e496af504.poster.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=395 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/60fbb8845338e6aba0a4aa3e496af504.webm?t=1724084465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644500/extras/829212aaa61a567c961e40ef3382e809.avif?t=1724084465\" width=616 height=620 /></span>",
